{"product":{"id":6829888766140,"title":"Norix RockSmart Molded Rocking Chair – RA16 \/ RA18","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eNorix RockSmart Rocking Chair\u003c\/strong\u003e is a one-piece, rotationally molded rocker designed for therapeutic rocking in behavioral healthcare and correctional facilities. Its generous arc gives a relaxing, safe rocking action, and rear bumpers mark the limits of safe rocking. The ligature-resistant design has no internal openings, creases, or nooks where contraband can be hidden.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe chair is molded from high-impact polyethylene with UV stabilizers and Norix TruColor polymer for consistent, lasting color. It comes in 16” and 18” sizes, each in a standard or heavier weight model, with or without nylon runners to protect floors. The seamless surface can be cleaned with bleach solutions and hospital-grade disinfectants.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/strong\u003e One-piece, rotationally molded high-impact polyethylene with ultraviolet light stabilizers to reduce fading\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTruColor Polymer:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully compounded color for consistent color and durability\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRocking Action:\u003c\/strong\u003e Generous arc for a relaxing and safe rock; rear nylon bumpers mark the limits of safe rocking\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRunners:\u003c\/strong\u003e Securely affixed nylon runners protect floors (models without runners are also available)\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLigature Resistant:\u003c\/strong\u003e No internal openings\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eChemical Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Resists blood, vinegar, urine, feces, salt solution, and chlorine solution\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e16” Rocker Size:\u003c\/strong\u003e 25.5”W×40.2”D×41.4”H, with a 17.5” seat height and 20.5” seat width\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e18” Rocker Size:\u003c\/strong\u003e 27”W×45”D×44”H, with an 18.5” seat height and 21.8” seat width\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 49 lbs (16” standard), 51 lbs (18” standard), or 71 lbs (heavier weight models)\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eColors:\u003c\/strong\u003e Twilight, Cove, Sage, Clay, Sand, or Dove\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStatic Load Testing:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tested to 1,000 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePerformance Standards:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dynamic drop tested to twice the ANSI\/BIFMA X5.4 impact force (250 lbs from 18”)\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFlammability Standards:\u003c\/strong\u003e California Technical Bulletins 133 and 117; UL 1056; ASTM E1537; UL 94 HB; NFPA 261\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEnvironmental Certification:\u003c\/strong\u003e GREENGUARD and GREENGUARD Gold\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCleaning:\u003c\/strong\u003e Simple Green or a similar cleaner for routine cleaning; bleach and water solutions and hospital-grade disinfectants such as Virex, Wexcide, or Oxivir Five 16 can be used per the manufacturer’s instructions\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSafety Note:\u003c\/strong\u003e The rear bumpers deter backward tipping, but rocking aggressively may cause the chair to tip over; do not stand on the chair\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWarranty:\u003c\/strong\u003e 10-year limited replacement warranty\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIntended Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Indoor use only\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCountry of Manufacture:\u003c\/strong\u003e USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Models and Options\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRA16 – 16” Standard:\u003c\/strong\u003e With runners, 49 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRA16-71 – 16” Heavier Weight:\u003c\/strong\u003e With runners, 71 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRA18 – 18” Standard:\u003c\/strong\u003e With runners, 51 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRA18-71 – 18” Heavier Weight:\u003c\/strong\u003e With runners, 71 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRA16-NR \/ RA16-NR-71 – 16” without Runners:\u003c\/strong\u003e Standard (49 lbs) or heavier weight (71 lbs)\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRA18-NR \/ RA18-NR-71 – 18” without Runners:\u003c\/strong\u003e Standard (51 lbs) or heavier weight (71 lbs)\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eExtended Colors:\u003c\/strong\u003e Citrus, Malibu, Cobalt, Tranquil, Wisteria, LUX Ivory, and LUX Onyx, with a minimum order of 6 per color\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInstallation and Options\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eNo assembly is required\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eApplications\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Norix RockSmart Rocking Chair suits rooms where residents benefit from calming, rhythmic movement, in spaces where a standard rocker would not be safe.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTypical applications include:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eDayrooms, activity rooms, and group rooms in behavioral healthcare facilities and psychiatric hospitals\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eComfort rooms and calming rooms\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eWaiting areas and visitation rooms\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eDayrooms and group rooms in correctional and detention facilities\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExplore Anchortex's \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.anchortex.com\/collections\/bh-behavioral-healthcare-furniture\"\u003eBehavioral Healthcare Anti-Ligature Furniture\u003c\/a\u003e collections for more institutional furniture.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eAbout Norix Seating\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNorix makes seating for behavioral healthcare, correctional, and other high-use facilities, from lightweight stackable chairs for staff areas to heavy, ballastable lounge seating for patient and inmate areas.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Norix seating range includes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStackable Chairs:\u003c\/strong\u003e Integra, Progress, and Affinity\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eGuest and Lounge Seating:\u003c\/strong\u003e Flux, Forté, Vesta, Hondo Nuevo, Ripple, Wink, and Toro\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIndoor and Outdoor Seating:\u003c\/strong\u003e Coupe, Flux, Pax, Kube, Goby, and Riptide\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eUpholstered Seating:\u003c\/strong\u003e Forma, Element, Harmony, and Respite\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRockers and Stools:\u003c\/strong\u003e Flux, Rocksmart, Mix-Up, and B-Side\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMetal Seating:\u003c\/strong\u003e VersaFrame, Boulder, and Terra\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eAbout Norix Furniture\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNorix manufactures durable furniture for demanding environments, including behavioral healthcare facilities, psychiatric hospitals, police stations, correctional institutions, and residential treatment centers. Explore the full line of \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.anchortex.com\/collections\/norix-furniture\"\u003eNorix Furniture\u003c\/a\u003e at Anchortex.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Norix","product_type":"","created_at":"2021-06-10T11:11:19-04:00","handle":"norix-rocksmart-rocking-chair","updated_at":"2026-11-26T18:27:5